WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.378
MySQL va SQLite da saralash farqlari

00:12.378 --> 00:24.127
MySQL: NULL eng kichik va IS NULL usuli

00:24.127 --> 00:36.347
MySQL: LIMIT m, n va FETCH yo‘qligi

00:36.347 --> 00:46.900
SQLite: NULLS LAST va manfiy LIMIT

00:46.900 --> 00:57.478
Uch tizimning saralash solishtiruvi

00:57.478 --> 01:11.320
Uch tizim qiyosiy xulosasi
